flowchart TD
    H[Human or CI intent] --> C[Markdown research contracts]
    C --> R[YAML recipe graph]
    R --> A[Primary Agent Adapter]

    subgraph O[Multiagent Operator Plane]
      A --> OR[Specialist roles]
      OR --> PL[Planner]
      OR --> RS[Researcher]
      OR --> RA[Runtime Analyst]
      OR --> FA[Forensics Analyst]
      OR --> DA[Detection Analyst]
      OR --> VE[Verifier]
      OR --> RG[Report Generator]
      A --> CR[CrewAI optional coordination]
      A --> SK[Versioned skills]
      A --> MCP[Scoped MCP tools]
    end

    R --> GW[Model / Harness Gateway Plane]
    subgraph G[Gateway Plane]
      GW --> LT[LiteLLM<br/>model routing + fallback + telemetry]
      GW --> OM[OmniRoute<br/>provider routing + fallback]
    end

    A --> X[Agent execution]
    PL --> X
    RS --> X
    RA --> X
    FA --> X
    DA --> X
    X --> RV[Review / Approval]
    RV --> VM[Disposable Lima / QEMU VM]

    subgraph EX[Controlled Execution Plane]
      VM --> IN[Instrumentation selected by workload recipe]
      IN --> WK[Approved workload]
      WK --> COL[Telemetry + raw evidence collection]
    end

    COL --> BB[Blackboard / durable case store]
    subgraph B[Evidence and Analysis Plane]
      BB --> ART[Immutable raw artifacts + hashes + provenance]
      BB --> AUD[Run + audit records]
      BB --> TEL[Telemetry]
      BB --> AN[Evidence analysis]
      BB --> FIND[Findings]
      AN --> RG
      FIND --> RG
      VE --> IV[Independent verification]
      RG --> RR[Research Report<br/>key platform output]
      IV --> RR
    end

    RR --> PR[Preserve case]
    PR --> DEST[Destroy disposable VM]
    RR --> LEARN[Evidence-bounded learning]
    LEARN --> CAND[Candidate skill / recipe improvement]
    CAND --> REPLAY[Replay on distinct evidence]
    REPLAY --> IV

    PC[policyctl<br/>outside agent control plane] -. policy / audit signal .-> RV
    SEC[VM/OS security boundary<br/>mounts credentials privilege network] --- VM

    classDef declarative fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef agent fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px
    classDef gateway fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evidence fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px
    classDef security fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px
    class C,R declarative
    class A,OR,PL,RS,RA,FA,DA,VE,RG,CR,SK,MCP,X agent
    class GW,LT,OM gateway
    class BB,ART,AUD,TEL,AN,FIND,RR,IV evidence
    class VM,SEC security

    %% Invariant: the project is multiagentic, but no model, agent, role, skill, MCP server, gateway or orchestrator is the sandbox.
